    <data key="d0">Cookpad Log Collection, Retention, and Analysis Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qN5-v4NlKac</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless security log monitoring architecture handling 330 million logs (270 GB) per month at extremely low cost (~$2/month).</data>
    <data key="d3">Security Monitoring &amp; Log Analytics</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
